#   tree_builder_3 - Layout::TreeBuilder: before and after children, build, the table fixup
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of LibWeb/Layout/TreeBuilder.cpp (lines 899-1379): the ::before box, the SVG mask,
#       clip-path and pattern subtrees, the ::marker and ::after boxes and the anonymous
#       fieldset content box, TreeBuilder::build, and the CSS tables fixup algorithm (removing
#       irrelevant boxes, generating missing child wrappers and parents, table wrappers, and
#       missing cells).
